    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Clears all events you schedule, including any events in the middle of playing.",
      "ko": "The necessary parameters for this type are [`frequency`](avaudiouniteqfilterparameters/frequency.md) (center) and [`bandwidth`](avaudiouniteqfilterparameters/bandwidth.md).",
      "sourceHash": "8f207ce964d7d64b47e00b76052217c4f0f513bcb0e4f7e77d603764618ee24f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "It resets the node’s sample time to `0`, and doesn’t proceed until the node starts again through [`play()`](avaudioplayernode/play().md) or [`play(at:)`](avaudioplayernode/play(at:).md).",
      "ko": "노드의 샘플 시간을 `0`으로 재설정하고, 노드가 [`play()`](avaudioplayernode/play().md) 또는 [`play(at:)`](avaudioplayernode/play(at:).md)를 통해 다시 시작될 때까지 진행되지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b021b5f871d9bc9092ef00bc3df063737310066d67040dca8915bd96c9bd2ec6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Pausing or stopping all of the players you connect to an engine doesn’t pause or stop the engine or the underlying hardware.",
      "ko": "엔진에 연결한 모든 플레이어를 일시 중지하거나 중지해도 엔진이나 하드웨어는 일시 중지되거나 중지되지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6757980f29896b67e8f7653a86ca717b1b6c4d0985860ba2a5ffdb870b76a730",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "You must explicitly pause or stop the engine for the hardware to stop.",
      "ko": "하드웨어를 정지하려면 엔진을 명시적으로 일시 중지하거나 중지해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f60c4ff3e535ea846ac113a69c0f9f742131492a0cdc5c90b9aaa1af8dd92803",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "When your app doesn’t need to play audio, pause or stop the engine to minimize power consumption.",
      "ko": "앱에서 오디오 재생이 필요하지 않을 때 전력 소비를 최소화하려면 엔진을 일시 중지하거나 중지해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "0b76ce92d3ab1e4d40a76f4c9f6578934b1cd4ffc23e5a181c0e0a61cd08b2c4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
